WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.406
Bot flew the spaceship through space.

2
00:00:16.407 --> 00:00:21.304
Ringo held his belly.

3
00:00:21.305 --> 00:00:31.243
"I feel space sick," he said.

4
00:00:31.244 --> 00:00:33.713
"Here," Bot said.

5
00:00:33.714 --> 00:00:37.337
She gave him a snack.

6
00:00:37.338 --> 00:00:39.954
"Have a solar bar.

7
00:00:39.955 --> 00:00:44.595
You'll feel better."

8
00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:48.444
Just then they flew past a planet.

9
00:00:48.445 --> 00:00:52.368
Ringo saw purple clouds.

10
00:00:52.369 --> 00:00:58.376
"That's Purple Planet," Bot said. "Years ago—"

11
00:00:58.377 --> 00:01:00.874
Pop! The map went dark.

12
00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:04.091
Shwoop! The spaceship dropped!

13
00:01:04.092 --> 00:01:08.093
"Uh-oh." Bot sounded worried.

14
00:01:08.094 --> 00:01:12.510
Ringo gulped. "What's going on?"

15
00:01:12.511 --> 00:01:16.092
"I don't know," Bot said.

16
00:01:16.093 --> 00:01:18.704
"I think we're landing!"

17
00:01:18.705 --> 00:01:46.216
"Already?" Ringo said.

18
00:01:46.217 --> 00:01:48.829
Ringo and Bot looked outside.

19
00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:53.667
Bot made a sound. Err!

20
00:01:53.668 --> 00:01:58.082
"Oops! This isn't Blue Moon," she said.

21
00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:06.099
"It's Pink Moon!"

22
00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.408
Ringo checked Bot.

23
00:02:09.409 --> 00:02:14.854
"I see more loose bolts," he said.

24
00:02:14.855 --> 00:02:20.212
Ringo turned the bolts, and bing!

25
00:02:20.213 --> 00:02:26.267
The map lit up again.

26
00:02:26.268 --> 00:02:32.341
Soon the spaceship blasted off again.

27
00:02:32.342 --> 00:02:36.425
"I hope we can find that tool," Bot said.

28
00:02:36.426 --> 00:02:39.063
"Me too," Ringo said.

29
00:02:39.064 --> 00:02:48.093
"I want to stay in Space Patrol."

30
00:02:48.094 --> 00:02:58.138
Hours later they finally landed.

31
00:02:58.139 --> 00:03:02.391
Blue Moon looked dry and dusty.

32
00:03:02.392 --> 00:03:06.863
Ringo wiped his nose. "Come on, Bot.

33
00:03:06.864 --> 00:03:17.206
Let's finish our mission."

